      <title>Letter: Beware of data centers</title>
      <link>https://www.albertleatribune.com/opinion/letter-beware-of-data-centers-edd77bfe</link>
      <description>Data centers pay high property taxes and offer some well-paid jobs; however, the other impacts of data centers must be considered. Large data centers can consume huge amounts of electricity, up to 1,000 megawatts, enough for 800,000 homes, providing a challenge to local power supplies.</description>
